MaiPai Shared
Third-Party Licenses and Attributions

This repo holds the org's shared libraries (ui, core, spec), extracted
from Home and the Stack. Attributions below are added as each
workspace's own dependencies land, per docs/PACKAGES.md in
getmaipai/.github.

## core

- Hono (MIT) - https://hono.dev (`openapi.ts`'s router; `secretThrottle.ts`'s
  connection-info lookup)
- @hono/zod-openapi (MIT) - https://github.com/honojs/middleware
  (`openapi.ts`'s route/schema scaffolding)
- Zod (MIT) - https://zod.dev (`openapi.ts`'s schemas)

